<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Friday that Gillette Co and Torchmark Corp were not available for after-hours trading.</p>
<p>Gillette reported fourth-quarter earnings of $0.21 a share after charges against $0.64 for the same period last year.</p>
<p>Torchmark also reported fourth-quarter earnings with operating share at $1.17 against $1.03.</p>
<p>The exchange said Corimon SACA, Westmoreland Coal Co and Westmoreland preferred A stock were also not available.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
